<!-- ══ Pass-25 (#3: navigation icon set — the SEND glyph, restyled) ═════
     The complete navigation-bar redesign unifies the three tab icons in
     one stroke-drawn language (1.65dp round caps/joins, identical inset
     grid): Transfers (ic_swap) and Settings (ic_settings) were already
     stroke glyphs, but Send was the app's one FILLED icon — visibly
     heavier than its neighbors at 24dp and optically out of the set.
     Redrawn as the classic stroke paper plane, matching the other two
     glyphs' weight and grid exactly. Used only where "send" already meant
     send (the nav item, the target picker's rows and dialogs). -->
